{"code":0,"message":"成功","data":{"docId":623684,"content":"<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 200%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 200%; font-family: 宋体;\">“N皇冠新材”（001381）盘中成交价较开盘价首次上涨达到或超过60%，根据《深圳证券交易所交易规则》等有关规定，本所自今日10时45分52秒起对该证券实施临时停牌，于10时55分53秒复牌。<span lang=\"EN-US\"><span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 200%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 200%; font-family: 宋体;\">本所郑重提示广大投资者注意投资风险，理性投资。<span lang=\"EN-US\"><span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 200%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 200%; font-family: 宋体;\">特此公告<span lang=\"EN-US\"><span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 200%;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 200%; font-family: 宋体;\"><span style=\"mso-tab-count: 1;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <\/span><span><\/span><\/span><\/p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"right\" style=\"margin-right: 21.0pt; mso-para-margin-right: 2.0gd; text-align: right; line-height: 200%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 200%; font-family: 宋体;\">深圳证券交易所<span lang=\"EN-US\"><span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"right\" style=\"margin-right: 21.0pt; mso-para-margin-right: 2.0gd; text-align: right; line-height: 200%;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 200%; font-family: 宋体;\">2026年11月03日<span lang=\"EN-US\"><span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>","title":"关于“N皇冠新材”盘中临时停牌的公告","subDocTitle":"","channelId":213,"domain":"http://www.szse.cn","docPeople":"","docAbstract":"自动发布","chnlCode":"tempsuspension_news","pubTime":1793673952000,"url":"/disclosure/notice/temp/t20261103_623684.html","jsonPath":"/disclosure/notice/temp/t20261103_623684.json","docTitleStatusTime":""}}